values ('e2a7c4d9-5b18-4f03-8c62-1d9e0a6b3f85', 'gerontological-nursing', 'Gerontological Nursing', 'This course prepares nursing students to care for older adults across home, community, acute, rehabilitation, assisted living, long-term care, and palliative settings. Students learn normal aging, geriatric syndromes, cognition, medication safety, mobility, function, nutrition, skin integrity, chronic disease, palliative care, ethics, caregiver partnership, transitions, and evidence-based age-friendly nursing practice.');

